    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποψῑλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip off hair, make bald,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				538
			</span></i>; of a barber, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ πύκνωμα τῶν τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.66
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				827
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>strip bare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀστέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Foet.Exsect.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Κύρου οἶκον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>strip bare of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλων τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					695
				</span></i>
			.</div>
